  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HIV and Harm Reduction in Eastern Africa - Eastern Africa - Multicountry Eastern Africa KANCO (01-Oct-2015-30-Sep-2018)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multicountry Eastern Africa KANCO, HIV, Kenya AIDS NGOs Consortium (KANCO)This program has the following goals: Increase access to essential HIV and harm reduction services for people who inject drugs in Eastern Africa. The objectives of this program are: Creating an enabling environment to conduct harm reduction activities in Eastern Africa.  Generating and utilising strategic informationn on drug use related interventions in the region.  Strengthening of community systems for sustained HIV response among people who inject drugs in Eastern Africa</narrative>
  </description>
